{
 "_comment": [
  "The 'Activation' dashboard: the new-user funnel, from GET /api/admin/metrics",
  "(payload.activation) via the textfile exporter in this directory",
  "(pqp-api-metrics-exporter.py). Standard Grafana dashboard JSON model:",
  "Dashboards > New > Import, paste this file.",
  "",
  "Replace <PROMETHEUS_DATASOURCE_UID> with the real UID from Administration >",
  "Data sources (the Grafana Cloud Prometheus stack the pqp-sfu-box dashboard",
  "already uses); the import dialog also offers to remap it.",
  "",
  "EVERY panel needs pqp-api-metrics-exporter.py installed and running (see this",
  "directory's README) -- without it they read 'No data', the honest state.",
  "",
  "THE FUNNEL IS A COHORT BY SIGNUP DATE. A window's Signup bar is the accounts",
  "that signed up in the last 7 / 30 days; each later bar is how many of THAT",
  "cohort have reached the step since. Steps only happen after signup, so a bar",
  "is always <= the one above it and step/signup is a real conversion. The seam",
  "that stamps every step is recordActivationStep in server/src/services/",
  "activation.ts; the same seam is where a per-user sink (PostHog) would attach.",
  "See docs/MONITORING.md."
 ],
 "title": "pqp Activation",
 "uid": "pqp-api-activation",
 "tags": [
  "pqp",
  "activation",
  "growth"
 ],
 "timezone": "utc",
 "editable": true,
 "graphTooltip": 1,
 "time": {
  "from": "now-30d",
  "to": "now"
 },
 "refresh": "5m",
 "schemaVersion": 39,
 "version": 1,
 "panels": [
  {
   "id": 1,
   "title": "Activation funnel (30-day signup cohort)",
   "type": "bargauge",
   "gridPos": {
    "h": 9,
    "w": 12,
    "x": 0,
    "y": 0
   },
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "<PROMETHEUS_DATASOURCE_UID>"
   },
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "short",
     "min": 0,
     "color": {
      "mode": "continuous-GrYlRd"
     }
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "options": {
    "displayMode": "gradient",
    "orientation": "horizontal",
    "showUnfilled": true,
    "valueMode": "color",
    "reduceOptions": {
     "calcs": [
      "lastNotNull"
     ],
     "fields": "",
     "values": false
    }
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "<PROMETHEUS_DATASOURCE_UID>"
     },
     "expr": "pqp_api_activation_cohort{window=\"30d\",step=\"signup\"}",
     "legendFormat": "1 Signup",
     "instant": true
    },
    {
     "refId": "B",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "<PROMETHEUS_DATASOURCE_UID>"
     },
     "expr": "pqp_api_activation_cohort{window=\"30d\",step=\"age_gate\"}",
     "legendFormat": "2 Age gate",
     "instant": true
    },
    {
     "refId": "C",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "<PROMETHEUS_DATASOURCE_UID>"
     },
     "expr": "pqp_api_activation_cohort{window=\"30d\",step=\"handle\"}",
     "legendFormat": "3 Handle",
     "instant": true
    },
    {
     "refId": "D",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "<PROMETHEUS_DATASOURCE_UID>"
     },
     "expr": "pqp_api_activation_cohort{window=\"30d\",step=\"first_join\"}",
     "legendFormat": "4 First join",
     "instant": true
    },
    {
     "refId": "E",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "<PROMETHEUS_DATASOURCE_UID>"
     },
     "expr": "pqp_api_activation_cohort{window=\"30d\",step=\"first_message\"}",
     "legendFormat": "5 First message",
     "instant": true
    },
    {
     "refId": "F",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "<PROMETHEUS_DATASOURCE_UID>"
     },
     "expr": "pqp_api_activation_cohort{window=\"30d\",step=\"first_voice\"}",
     "legendFormat": "6 First voice",
     "instant": true
    },
    {
     "refId": "G",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "<PROMETHEUS_DATASOURCE_UID>"
     },
     "expr": "pqp_api_activation_cohort{window=\"30d\",step=\"first_watch_party\"}",
     "legendFormat": "7 First watch party",
     "instant": true
    }
   ],
   "description": "Of the accounts whose signup_at is in the last 30 days, how many have reached each step (pqp_api_activation_cohort{window=\"30d\"}). Each bar is <= the one above; the drop between two bars is the funnel drop-off. step 1 (Signup) is the cohort size. Read this window for a settled picture."
  },
